@startuml 01-coordination-event-and-actor
' 图 01：Agent Orchestration 结构与表示（类图）
' 一状态 + 一变更 + 一边界
' 贯穿案例：「请调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式并撰写一份详细的调研报告」

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam padding 8

title 图 01：Agent Orchestration 结构与表示

top to bottom direction

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 边界
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

package "边界" #FFFFFF {

  class ExternalInput {
    用户输入 / 工具回执 / Webhook
    ..
    来自编排系统之外
    例 用户消息「请调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式并撰写一份详细的调研报告」
    此时尚未产生协调变更
  }

  class ObservationEntry {
    +seq: Int
    +source: ActorRef
    +payloadRef: ContentRef
    +receivedAt: Timestamp
    ..
    seq 观察日志顺序号
    例 1
    source 触发方，常为 Human
    例 human-alice / Human
    payloadRef 原始内容引用
    例 ref:msg-001 → 上述调研请求全文
    receivedAt 系统收到时间
    例 2026-08-06T13:00:00+08:00
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 协作快照（状态）
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

package "协作快照" #E8F4FD {

  class CollaborationSnapshot {
    +epochId: EpochId
    --
    +participants: Set ActorRegistration
    +artifacts: Set WorkArtifact
    +capabilities: Set ScopedCapability
    +sessions: Set CommunicationSession
    +links: Set CollaborationLink
    --
    +auditTail: List ObservationEntry
    +policyContext: PolicyContext
    ..
    epochId 编排模式世代，用于版本对齐与重放
    例 epoch-research-v1
    participants 协作图中已注册执行体
    例 human-alice, agent-planner, agent-researcher, tool-web-search
    artifacts 任务、计划、代码等工作产物
    例 task-T-ontology-report, plan-P-outline, doc-draft-report
    capabilities 写锁、预算、审批槽等稀缺资源
    例 budget-50k-tokens, write-lock-doc-draft
    sessions 私有或共享通信会话
    例 session-planner-researcher
    links 依赖、委派、等待、供数等关系
    例 task-T → delegated-to → agent-researcher
    auditTail 有序外部观察日志，新信号先落此处
    例 [ObservationEntry#1: 调研请求]
    policyContext 授权、投票、重试与反馈状态
    例 approved-introduce, retry-count=0
  }

  class WorkArtifact {
    +id: ArtifactId
    +kind: ArtifactKind
    +contentRef: ContentRef
    +owner: ActorRef
    ..
    id 产物实例 ID
    例 task-T-ontology-report
    kind 任务 / 计划 / 代码 / 评审意见
    例 Task
    contentRef 任务正文存放处，不在 CoordinationEvent
    例 ref:task-body →「调研本体工程与 Palantir 模式，输出详细调研报告」
    owner 当前负责该产物的执行体
    例 agent-researcher / Agent
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 协调变更（事件记录）
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

package "协调变更" #FFF8E8 {

  class CoordinationEvent {
    +changeId: ChangeId
    +epochId: EpochId
    +operation: OperationType
    +recordedAt: Timestamp
    +visibility: EventVisibility
    --
    +beforeRef: SnapshotRef
    +afterRef: SnapshotRef
    --
    +initiator: ActorRef
    +involved: List ActorRef
    +targets: EventTargets
    --
    +authorization: EvidenceRef
    +external: EvidenceRef
    ..
    changeId 变更日志全局唯一 ID
    例 evt-002-delegate
    operation 操作种类，见 OperationType
    例 delegate
    beforeRef / afterRef 变更前后快照，重放校验用
    例 snap-003 → snap-004
    initiator 主责执行体（归因，不是触发器）
    例 agent-planner / Agent
    involved 其他参与方
    例 [agent-researcher]（被委派方）
    targets 作用对象引用，不含任务正文
    例 primary=task-T-ontology-report
    authorization 策略授权证据
    例 authz-delegate-ok
    external 常指向 auditTail 中的 ObservationEntry
    例 ref:audit#1（原始调研请求）
    --
    运行时准入后才写入；执行体不直接 emit
  }

  class EventTargets {
    +primary: TargetRef
    +secondary: List TargetRef
    ..
    primary 首要对象
    例 task-T-ontology-report / Task
    secondary 连带对象
    例 [session-planner-researcher, write-lock-doc-draft]
  }

  class TargetRef {
    +kind: TargetKind
    +id: String
    ..
    kind 任务 / 产物 / 资源 / 会话 / 边 / 执行体
    例 Task
    id 实例 ID；kind=participant 时即 actorId
    例 task-T-ontology-report
  }

  enum OperationType {
    introduce_artifact
    delegate
    accept
    invoke_tool
    run_shell
    request_approval
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 执行体（双视图）
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

package "执行体" #FFF3E0 {

  class ActorRegistration {
    +actorId: ActorId
    +kind: ActorKind
    +displayName: String
    +provider: String
    +status: ActorStatus
    ..
    actorId 协作世界主键，生命周期内不变
    例 agent-researcher
    kind Agent / Shell / Tool / DataSource / Human / Runtime
    例 Agent
    displayName UI 与日志展示名
    例 Research Agent
    provider gpt-4、bash、postgresql、某 MCP
    例 claude-sonnet
    status 调度态：active / waiting / blocked
    例 active（正在检索 Palantir 资料）
  }

  class ActorRef {
    +actorId: ActorId
    +kind: ActorKind
    ..
    actorId 解析键，指向 ActorRegistration
    例 agent-planner
    kind 类别冗余，便于过滤与路由
    例 Agent
  }

  enum ActorKind {
    Agent
    Shell
    Tool
    DataSource
    Human
    Runtime
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 布局
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

ExternalInput -[hidden]down- ObservationEntry
ObservationEntry -[hidden]down- CollaborationSnapshot
CollaborationSnapshot -[hidden]down- CoordinationEvent

CollaborationSnapshot -[hidden]right- ActorRegistration
ActorRegistration -[hidden]down- WorkArtifact
CoordinationEvent -[hidden]right- ActorRef
ActorRef -[hidden]down- EventTargets
EventTargets -[hidden]down- TargetRef
TargetRef -[hidden]down- OperationType

' ═══════════════════════════════════════
' 关系（少而清晰）
' ═══════════════════════════════════════

ExternalInput -down-> ObservationEntry : ① 外部信号
ObservationEntry -down-> CollaborationSnapshot : ② 追加 auditTail

CoordinationEvent -up-> CollaborationSnapshot : ③ 应用变更

CollaborationSnapshot *-right- ActorRegistration
CollaborationSnapshot *-right- WorkArtifact

CoordinationEvent *-right- ActorRef : initiator / involved
CoordinationEvent *-right- EventTargets : targets
EventTargets *-down- TargetRef

ActorRef -up-> ActorRegistration : 解析
TargetRef -up-> WorkArtifact : 指向产物
CoordinationEvent -left-> ObservationEntry : external

CoordinationEvent -down-> OperationType : operation
ActorRegistration -down-> ActorKind : kind
ActorRef -down-> ActorKind : kind

note bottom of CoordinationEvent
  **案例故事线：本体工程与 Palantir 调研报告**
  T0 有 human-alice、agent-planner、agent-researcher，尚无 task
  ① Alice 输入调研请求 → ObservationEntry#1 → auditTail
  ② Event#1 introduce_artifact → 创建 task-T-ontology-report
  ③ Event#2 delegate → planner 委派给 researcher，新建 session
  ④ Event#3 accept → researcher 接单
  ⑤ Event#4 invoke_tool → web-search 检索本体工程 / Palantir 资料
  ⑥ 后续 run_shell / submit_artifact → 产出 doc-draft-report
end note

@enduml
